### Below combination will ignore all files without extension ###
# Ignore all
*

# Unignore all with extensions
!*.*

# Unignore all dirs
!*/

### Above combination will ignore all files without extension ###
### Any additional rules must come after this point ###

# Dockerfiles?
!dockerfile

### Add some standard ignore rules ###
# Compiled source #
###################
*.com
*.class
*.dll
*.exe
*.o
*.so

# Packages #
############
# it's better to unpack these files and commit the raw source
# git has its own built in compression methods
*.7z
*.dmg
*.gz
*.iso
*.jar
*.rar
*.tar
*.zip

# KM3NeT specific
*.root
